            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>According to an aspect, an apparatus having a housing that encloses a printed circuit board substrate. The printed circuit board substrate includes electronic circuitry configured to receive media content wirelessly from a media content source. The apparatus includes an output cord segment having a first end portion fixedly coupled to the printed circuit board substrate within the housing of the media streaming device such that the output cord segment is un-pluggable from the media streaming device under normal conditions, and a second end portion configured to be coupled to a media port of a display device. The electronic circuitry is further configured to transmit the received media content through the output cord segment to the display device. The apparatus may include a power cord segment having a first end portion configured to be coupled to the media streaming device, and a second end portion configured to be coupled to a power source.</p>
            </abstract>
